# Everything the Test workflow installs: the runtime dependencies, the test
# runner and the test-only dependency, compiled together so their versions
# fit each other. Compiled with the oldest supported Python, 3.9. pytest 9 and
# fpdf2 2.8.8 need 3.10, so the caps keep Dependabot from bumping them past
# it; lift them together with the Python 3.9 support.
-r ../../requirements.in
fpdf2<2.8.8
pytest<9
